sequenceDiagram
    participant S as SimulatedReadingSource<br/>(infrastructure)
    participant M as MonitoringService<br/>(services)
    participant V as DashboardViewModel<br/>(models)
    participant Q as QML delegates

    S->>S: tick()
    S->>M: readingsChanged(readings)
    M->>M: recompute worst severity
    M->>V: readingsUpdated(readings)
    V->>V: diff rows against current state
    alt some rows differ
        V->>Q: dataChanged(first, last, roles)
        Note over Q: delegates update in place,<br/>they are NOT recreated
    else nothing changed
        Note over V: emit nothing at all
    end
    alt overall severity changed
        M->>V: overallSeverityChanged(severity)
        V->>Q: overallSeverityChanged()
        Q->>Q: StStatusPill re-evaluates
    end
